    "detailed_description": "<strong>Introduction</strong><br>You take on the role of a young girl named Anna, who is looking for her brother, Ethan, who has mysteriously disappeared along with other people near the misty forest. After an arduous journey, a passage is discovered that leads to a cursed village, the legendary Rosaria Village. Now your mission is to discover the secrets of the place and save your brother.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br>- Explore the Village Rosaria, unlock doors, unlock shortcuts<br>- Meet strange creatures that inhabit the place<br>- Help people who got lost in the Village<br>- Break curses<br>- Upgrade your weapon<br>- Learn new combat techniques<br>- Get new gear like: The Elemental Gauntlet, Flashlight, Gas Mask and more.",
